PCD perception service (HarnessStudio v2, run pcd-port-20261103)

pcd_perception/ is an independent re-derivation of the PCD-Mask GroundingDINO path of Koorye/PCD
(https://github.com/Koorye/PCD @ 31b027ecf2a8b9a4e496aaa9478fb951e3d9270a). That repository carries NO licence;
no code was copied from it. Each rule cites the upstream file:line it re-derives. Data values (instruction regexes,
alias table, class list, thresholds 0.25/0.3, dilation 5) are restated facts of the method.

